; ScrMap.HandleInput head (r1 = this, r2 = _global, r4 = keyCode): _global.SRMap.Input(this, keyCode)
; true = handled (the d-pad, LB / RB, X: keys the retail map never used)
    Push [reg4]
    Push [reg1]
    EA_PushByte 2
    Push [reg2]
    Push ['SRMap']
    GetMember
    Push ['Input']
    CallMethod
    Not
    If map_input_pass
    op_74
    Return
map_input_pass:
